Description: Based on “Federated Causal Inference: Multi-Studies ATE Estimation Beyond Meta-Analysis” (R. Khellaf, A. Bellet, and J. Josse, 2025), this package implements a DATASHIELD client side package that orchestrates the federated computation of the average treatment effect using data collected in a randomized controlled trial (RCT) setting.
